# Cloudflare Pages redirects for wordplayleague.com
# Format: /source  /destination  status
# Drop this at the root of the Pages project (alongside index.html).
#
# Built 2026-09-26 from the live sitemaps plus the Wix editor page list.
# Rule of thumb applied here: redirect pages that have links or rankings,
# and let genuinely dead pages 404. Mass-redirecting unrelated pages to /
# is read as a soft 404 and passes nothing, so it is not done below.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A2P / SMS — the campaign quotes these two URLs in its consent description
# AND inside the opt-in message body every player receives. They are also the
# Privacy and Support URLs on the Slack Marketplace submission. These are
# rebuilt as real pages, not redirected. Listed here only as a reminder.
#   /privacy-policy   -> rebuild
#   /sms-terms        -> rebuild
#   /terms-of-service -> rebuild

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# /register is deliberately NOT redirected.
#
# The legacy A2P campaign (858) declares it by name as the web-form opt-in,
# and that page as written is what satisfied the registration. Nobody uses the
# form, but the audience for it is carriers and auditors, not players. Rebuild
# it verbatim on Cloudflare -- same fields (first name, last name, email*,
# phone*) and the same consent paragraph, which must keep reading:
#
#   "By providing your mobile phone number and clicking "Register", you agree
#    to receive automated text messages from Wordplay League at the number you
#    provide, including score confirmations, league standings, and other
#    information related to your participation in Wordplay League. Message and
#    data rates may apply. Reply STOP to cancel, HELP for help. See our Text
#    Messaging Terms and Privacy Policy."
#
# Keep it noindexed, and keep both legal links live.

